<title>UK: EIB sets 15 billion peseta 10-year bond.</title>
<headline>EIB sets 15 billion peseta 10-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by joint lead managers Banco Santender de Negocios and UBS.</p>
<p> BORROWER   EUROPEAN INVESTMENT BANK</p>
<p> AMT    15 BLN PTA    COUPON     6.50	MATURITY    20.MAR.07</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  100.03    PAY DATE    20.MAR.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.875     LISTING    MADRID    PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  AAA/AAA   DENOMS (K) 100	 SALE LIMITS =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.875     SELL CONC  1.0	 PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
